Angela, in season six of The Office, Dwight and Andy sing Boulevard of Broken Dreams in the Secret Santa episode.
安吉拉，在《办公室》第六季中，德怀特和安迪在“秘密圣诞老人”那一集中唱了《Boulevard of Broken Dreams》。

173
00:08:41.860 --> 00:08:43.460
What are you trying to tell me, Jenna?
你想告诉我什么，珍娜？

174
00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:44.340
What is happening?
到底发生了什么？

175
00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:45.900
Is this an episode of Lost?
这是《迷失》的一集吗？

176
00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:47.520
Is this an episode of Lost?
这是《迷失》的一集吗？

177
00:08:47.640 --> 00:08:48.260
Group Mind!
集体思维！

178
00:08:49.180 --> 00:08:50.180
Group Minds?
集体思维？

