这巧合也太多了。

185
00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:05.840
What's happening?
到底发生了什么？

186
00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:09.480
I think it's a collective of amazing creative minds.
我想这是一个了不起的创造性思维集合。

187
00:09:09.680 --> 00:09:11.300
It's a group mind of great stuff.
这是一个伟大作品的集体思维。

188
00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:12.320
You've got an iPhone.
你有iPhone。

189
00:09:12.460 --> 00:09:13.120
You've got The Office.
你有《办公室》。

190
00:09:13.260 --> 00:09:14.080
You've got Green Day.
你有绿日乐队。

191
00:09:14.340 --> 00:09:15.000
It's group mind.
这就是集体思维。

192
00:09:15.140 --> 00:09:15.440
I don't know.
我不知道。

193
00:09:16.420 --> 00:09:16.900
Okay.
好的。

194
00:09:17.140 --> 00:09:17.380
All right.
好吧。

195
00:09:17.460 --> 00:09:18.100
What's next, Jenna?
接下来是什么，珍娜？

196
00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:19.640
Fast Fact number three.
第三个冷知识。

197
