To refresh everyone's memories, we learned that most characters have the office of Dunder Mifflin behind them, behind them in that window as they're giving their talking heads.
帮大家回忆一下，我们了解到大多数角色在接受采访时，背景都是邓德·米夫林的办公室，就在他们身后的窗户里。

207
00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:06.660
