00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:19.860
However, very often, Jim would have a talking head all the time, and his talking heads had a window to the world behind him.
然而，吉姆的采访镜头经常会出现，他的背景里总有一扇通往外界的窗户。

212
00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:20.720
Yes.
是的。

213
00:10:20.900 --> 00:10:24.660
The point of that was because he had a future outside of this company.
这么做的用意是因为他在公司之外还有未来。

214
00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:25.300
Yes.
是的。

215
00:10:25.300 --> 00:10:25.420
Right?
对吧？

216
00:10:25.420 --> 00:10:26.620
He was going places.
他前途无量。

217
00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:27.420
Yes.
没错。

218
00:10:27.420 --> 00:10:35.660
Angela, in this episode, after the employees get the news that Dunder Mifflin Scranton is closing,
安吉拉，在这一集中，当员工们得知邓德·米夫林斯克兰顿分公司要关闭的消息后，

