我没注意到这一点。

225
00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:55.860
You have to watch it.
你得去看看。

226
00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:57.640
I have to go back and watch it.
我得回去重看一遍。

227
00:10:57.740 --> 00:11:03.820
Angela, you have a talking head where you're talking about Dunder Mifflin closing and outside world behind you.
安吉拉，你有一个采访镜头，当时你在谈论邓德·米夫林要关门的事，背景就是外面的世界。

228
00:11:03.820 --> 00:11:12.800
Same with Pam, same with Ryan, same with Phyllis, same with Stanley, and then when we find out that we're still stuck at Dunder Mifflin, Dunder Mifflin is behind us.
帕姆也是，瑞安也是，菲利斯也是，斯坦利也是。然后当我们发现我们还得困在邓德·米夫林时，邓德·米夫林就成了我们的背景。

229
00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:17.280
That is so wild because I really don't think I ever had talking heads on that wall.
这太疯狂了，因为我真的不记得我曾在那个墙面前拍过采访镜头。

230
00:11:17.460 --> 00:11:19.860
