回到斯克兰顿，梅雷迪思走进迈克尔的办公室，告诉他她依然愿意和他发生关系。

636
00:31:37.510 --> 00:31:39.090
She's still down to get down.
她依然愿意“搞点事情”。

637
00:31:39.690 --> 00:31:44.350
Yeah, because, you know, they made a pact years ago that they would sleep together on the last day of work.
是的，因为你知道，他们几年前曾约定在工作最后一天要发生关系。

638
00:31:44.450 --> 00:31:47.390
And Michael is like, I have no idea what you're talking about.
而迈克尔却说，我根本不知道你在说什么。

639
00:31:47.990 --> 00:31:54.810
Okay, this storyline, which is going to keep playing out of Meredith trying to figure out who she agreed to have sex with on her last day of work,
好的，这个情节——梅雷迪思试图弄清楚她到底和谁约定了在工作最后一天发生关系——

640
00:31:54.810 --> 00:32:00.750
this was an example of one of the storylines that got cut from the original NBC airing.
这是从NBC原始播出版本中删减掉的情节之一。

641
00:32:01.110 --> 00:32:01.790
Oh, okay.
哦，原来如此。

642
00:32:01.790 --> 00:32:07.110
So we were able to keep this storyline in because we got the extra time with the producer's cut.
所以我们能在制片人剪辑版中保留这个情节，因为我们有额外的时间。

643
00:32:07.270 --> 00:32:08.170
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

644
00:32:08.210 --> 00:32:09.430
And see, I love it.
你看，我喜欢这个。

645
00:32:09.450 --> 00:32:10.970
I feel like it fills out the picture.
我觉得这让整个画面更完整了。

646
00:32:11.270 --> 00:32:12.230
Yes, completely.
是的，完全同意。

647
00:32:12.550 --> 00:32:17.510
Well, Jenna, your character has a pretty big talking head coming up.
对了，珍娜，你的角色接下来有一段很重要的访谈。

648
00:32:17.510 --> 00:32:22.150
You know, it's interesting to see how the branch closing is affecting everyone.
你知道，看看分部关闭如何影响每个人是很有趣的。

649
00:32:22.350 --> 00:32:24.450
I mean, Stanley is elated, right?
我是说，斯坦利很高兴，对吧？

650
00:32:24.650 --> 00:32:26.350
He's going to retire early.
他打算提前退休了。

651
00:32:26.650 --> 00:32:27.350
Oh, yeah.
哦，没错。

652
00:32:27.770 --> 00:32:28.670
Stanley's elated.
斯坦利很高兴。

653
00:32:29.130 --> 00:32:30.650
Ryan says this worked out great.
瑞安说这事儿进展得很顺利。

