00:32:31.210 --> 00:32:33.670
And Pam is really happy.
帕姆也非常开心。

655
00:32:34.250 --> 00:32:35.070
Oh, yeah.
哦，没错。

656
00:32:35.270 --> 00:32:39.630
And we express all of those emotions with an exterior window behind us, Angela.
安吉拉，我们通过身后那扇窗户来表达所有这些情绪。

657
00:32:42.030 --> 00:32:49.090
Well, Pam says that she always thought that maybe she would make a big speech and slap someone and storm out.
嗯，帕姆说她一直以为自己可能会发表一番慷慨激昂的演讲，然后扇某人一巴掌，再愤然离去。

