00:33:20.430 --> 00:33:24.990
Well, he seems very concerned that Pam might be one of the Connecticut transfers.
嗯，他看起来非常担心帕姆可能会成为调往康涅狄格州的人员之一。

676
00:33:25.810 --> 00:33:30.350
