00:33:58.990 --> 00:33:59.850
Did she?
是这样吗？

691
00:34:00.050 --> 00:34:02.270
Patricia, this is a fantastic question.
帕特里夏，这是一个非常棒的问题。

692
00:34:02.590 --> 00:34:02.790
All right.
好的。

693
00:34:02.790 --> 00:34:06.450
Many of you out there have speculated about Angela and Roy.
你们很多人都在猜测安吉拉和罗伊之间的关系。

