about it.
讨论帖。

696
00:34:13.050 --> 00:34:15.190
So the answer, Patricia, is yes.
所以，帕特里夏，答案是肯定的。

697
00:34:15.330 --> 00:34:17.710
It seems like Angela always had a thing for Roy.
看起来安吉拉一直对罗伊有点意思。

698
00:34:17.950 --> 00:34:22.990
I love this question, Patricia, because this has given us an opportunity to track it.
我喜欢这个问题，帕特里夏，因为它给了我们一个机会去追踪这件事。

699
00:34:22.990 --> 00:34:29.810
But we're going to track this Angela-Roy flirtation, because it is real and it is happening.
我们要追踪一下安吉拉和罗伊之间的调情，因为这是真实存在的，而且正在发生。

700
00:34:30.310 --> 00:34:30.590
All right.
好的。

