So definitely it starts there.
所以绝对是从那时候开始的。

715
00:35:02.290 --> 00:35:06.550
And then in The Secret, when Angela and Phyllis are in the kitchen and they're cleaning out
然后在《秘密》那一集，安吉拉和菲利斯在厨房清理冰箱时，

