00:35:46.290 --> 00:35:50.050
The accountants are wondering if maybe Roy took the missing money.
会计们在怀疑是不是罗伊拿走了丢失的钱。

730
00:35:50.410 --> 00:35:54.150
Angela says absolutely not, that he has too much character.
安吉拉说绝对不可能，他的人品没问题。

731
00:35:54.410 --> 00:35:57.390
And Kevin asks Angela if she has a crush on Roy.
凯文问安吉拉是不是对罗伊有意思。

732
00:35:57.530 --> 00:35:59.570
And Angela gets very, very flustered.
安吉拉变得非常、非常慌乱。

733
00:36:00.950 --> 00:36:02.410
Oh, whoa.
哦，哇。

734
00:36:03.290 --> 00:36:04.750
She gets so flustered.
她变得特别慌乱。

735
00:36:05.010 --> 00:36:08.910
She like sort of messes up her words and then she sort of storms off.
她说话都变得语无伦次，然后气冲冲地走开了。

736
00:36:08.910 --> 00:36:10.870
And you can find this on the DVD set.
你可以在DVD套装里找到这个。

737
00:36:11.010 --> 00:36:14.030
It's on season two, disc four as a bonus feature.
它作为花絮收录在第二季第四张光盘里。

738
